        "text_2": {
          "type": "rich_text",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>To ensure accessibility across all device types and screen readers, we take the following actions:</p><ul><li>Ensure clear keyboard focus rings on all interactive buttons, inputs, and selectors.</li><li>Provide alternative text descriptions for all imagery, charts, and mascot graphics.</li><li>Maintain high typographic contrast against background surfaces.</li><li>Support screen magnification without loss of critical checkout features.</li></ul>"
